	ds-on\, interdisciplinary initiative designed for engineering graduate stu
	dents to tackle real-world challenges using cutting-edge technologies: Art
	ificial Intelligence\, Digital Engineering\, Model-Based Systems Engineeri
	ng (MBSE)\, and Industry 4.0. Over the course of 10 weeks\, students gain 
